SUMMARY:Pokémon Guessing Game
DESCRIPTION:Stop by the Pavonia Branch and guess the Pokémon’s silhouette to win a free card pack*!\n\nYou get up to 3 guesses. Pokémon silhouettes change every Monday and may be modified.\n\n \n\n*Packs are bulk cards in card sleeves.
