SUMMARY:Celebrate We Love Memoirs Day
DESCRIPTION:We Love Memoirs Day is celebrated on August 31! Celebrate all month long by checking out a memoir from our display. Discover inspiring\, funny\, courageous\, and unforgettable true stories from real people.\n\nFor ages 19 and up. \n\nHow to Participate:\n\n\n	Check out any memoir from our display.\n	Receive a free gift while supplies last!\n\n\nFor more information email name@example.org or call us at 000-000-0000.
