SUMMARY:Free Backpack Giveaway Distribution @ Pavonia Branch
DESCRIPTION:Free Backpack Giveaway\n\nStart the school year feeling prepared\, confident\, and ready to learn! The Jersey City Free Public Library invites local students and families to register for our Free Backpack Giveaway. Each backpack will include school supplies to help students return to the classroom with both style and comfort.\n\nThis giveaway is about more than supplies. It is about reminding every young person in our community that Jersey City is cheering them on as they begin a new school year filled with possibilities.\n\nWe extend our heartfelt thanks to the Jersey City Free Public Library Foundation for making this special initiative possible and for its continued commitment to supporting Jersey City’s children and families.\n\nRegistration is required. Sign up today to receive a free backpack and school supplies!
LOCATION:Pavonia Branch
CATEGORIES:August
UID:LibCal-17422-17295241
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/17295241
END:VEVENT
