SUMMARY:Monday Matinee: The Glass Castle
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate We Love Memoirs Day with a screening of The Glass Castle\, based on Jeannette Walls' bestselling memoir. This inspiring true story follows a young woman who overcomes a challenging childhood shaped by poverty\, resilience\, and the enduring bonds of family. \n\nFor ages 19 and up. Rated PG-13. \n\nFor more information email name@example.org or call us at 000-000-0000.
LOCATION:Pavonia Branch
CATEGORIES:August, Popular Events > Social Gatherings
