SUMMARY:SEWcial Meetup for Adults
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate National Sewing Month every Saturday in September with a casual Sewcial Meetup! Bring your sewing\, stitching\, knitting\, crocheting\, or other fiber art projects and connect with fellow sewers\, stitchers\, knitters\, and crocheters while enjoying time to create\, share ideas\, and socialize. All skill levels are welcome.\n\nThis is not a class or instructional program—it is a relaxed gathering where participants can work on their own projects\, meet other crafters\, and celebrate the joy of creating. Please bring your own supplies and project.\n\nFor ages 19 and up. \n\nFor more info email name@example.org or call us at (201)547-4808. \n
LOCATION:Pavonia Branch
CATEGORIES:Popular Events > Social Gatherings
