DESCRIPTION:Words Beyond Worlds is an organization dedicated to supporting and empowering ESL students through a range of services\, including tutoring\, conversation practice\, cultural exchange activities\, mentorship programs\, and tailored resources. We create an inclusive environment where all students can flourish\, build confidence\, and forge meaningful connections. \n\nWe are currently seeking students ages 5 to 11 who would like support in English. We offer homework help\, ESL instruction\, personalized reading and writing practice\, vocabulary building\, grammar support\, speaking and conversation practice\, and guided activities to strengthen overall communication skills. For any inquiries\, please contact name@example.org\n\nREGISTRATION IS REQUIRED! \n\nREGISTER HERE\n
LOCATION:Pavonia Branch
CATEGORIES:April
UID:LibCal-17422-17364928
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/17364928
END:VEVENT
