SUMMARY:Adult Fall Program - Kakkoii Social Japanese Club - Japanese Calligraphy
DESCRIPTION:Japanese Calligraphy\nReady to learn just enough Japanese to survive a calligraphy lesson? Discover the beauty of learning-while-doing with a professional calligraphy artist supported by bilingual host and anime convention interpreter Kiara (@KiaraNYCjp) Try your hand at traditional brush techniques and create your own artwork to take home.\n
LOCATION:Pavonia Branch
CATEGORIES:November, Popular Events, Popular Events > Arts and Crafts Events, Popular Events > Cultural Celebrations
