SUMMARY:Chess Club
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn the basics of chess?\n\nJoin us at the Pavonia Branch Library and learn how to play chess! Whether you're a beginner or just need a refresher\, we'll go over the basic rules\, pieces\, and moves. No need to bring anything—we provide the boards and pieces!\n\nFor ages 6-11. For more info email name@example.org or call us at 000-000-0000.
