SUMMARY:Teen Etiquette Workshop- Pavonia Branch
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging and interactive Teen Etiquette Workshop designed to help teens build confidence and develop essential social skills for school\, work\, and everyday life. Participants will learn proper table manners\, communication skills\, introductions and greetings\, professional etiquette\, appropriate social behavior\, and how to make a positive first impression.\n\nThrough fun activities\, discussions\, and real-life scenarios\, teens will gain the confidence and knowledge needed to navigate social and professional situations with respect\, confidence\, and poise
LOCATION:Pavonia Branch
CATEGORIES:November
